{'symbol': 'MRO', 'date': '2021-09-07 07:00:00', 'title': 'MARATHON OIL CORPORATION ANNOUNCES FULL REDEMPTION OF $900 MILLION 3.85% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2025', 'text': "HOUSTON, SEPT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0\xa0MARATHON OIL CORPORATION (NYSE: MRO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY FULLY REDEEMED ITS $900 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 3.85% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2025, ACCELERATING THE REALIZATION OF MARATHON OIL'S PREVIOUSLY DISCLOSED GROSS DEBT OBJECTIVE OF APPROXIMATELY $4.0 BILLION."}